    <node id="scott derrickson">
      <data key="d0">scott derrickson</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">Scott Derrickson is an American director, screenwriter, and producer, known for his work in horror films and the Marvel Cinematic Universe.&lt;SEP&gt;Scott Derrickson is a director who has collaborated with Tyler Bates, showcasing his versatility in film scoring.&lt;SEP&gt;Scott Derrickson is a filmmaker known for directing the short film 'Love in the Ruins', in which Adam Collis served as the assistant director.&lt;SEP&gt;Scott Derrickson is the director of the film Sinister, known for his work in the horror genre.&lt;SEP&gt;Scott Derrickson is the director of the film Deliver Us from Evil, contributing to its creative vision and execution.&lt;SEP&gt;Scott Derrickson is the director of Doctor Strange, contributing to its creative vision and direction.</data>
      <data key="d3">34b72246a9d3f37981adbdbe53e097d9ec79fd7cf222a44df679a6b8f03b1054_chunk_0&lt;SEP&gt;26fc9b7ced3ead7e3ff3c97acaa6a70cbaaf1101f57232d7c3764606a31e1ef8_chunk_0&lt;SEP&gt;dd3bb12dcd55a06387ec7e3b80dcf4fabc34c4af086ea1143f447d2f60edf3c6_chunk_0&lt;SEP&gt;e4289d8c558d892cd978d0a940821856d3a5e77b860d585eda30c9f18ebc0500_chunk_0&lt;SEP&gt;f22e802bcc30dca6103d3911bba8904f9db4a4f3aaccfb4d5c10714d4f5e89ea_chunk_0&lt;SEP&gt;5d29ea3f8dcc653be39a1e512b9582c4d7bbf653492276abc758067339073f3f_chunk_0</data>
