    <node id="corliss archer">
      <data key="d0">corliss archer</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Corliss Archer is a radio program from the Golden Age of radio that aired from January 7, 1943, to September 30, 1956, and is known for its long run despite having fewer than 24 episodes remaining.&lt;SEP&gt;Corliss Archer is a character in the film Kiss and Tell, portrayed by Shirley Temple, who navigates teenage relationships and parental concerns.&lt;SEP&gt;Corliss Archer is an American television sitcom that aired on CBS, adapted from a radio series and based on short stories by F. Hugh Herbert.</data>
      <data key="d3">4529d8056104a04dc8edd6241183fe5e359629446845f8fb92ff6bc0e66f13cb_chunk_0&lt;SEP&gt;57c7d9ff495cd503aef4ac147b6d544b251e97ae39d0bb2f1db0bf58fbef885a_chunk_0&lt;SEP&gt;1457313bbd3b7a24221bc943c2c0882a6bd10515d770c3ad58aa49a0ed246d35_chunk_0</data>
