    <node id="the hork bajir chronicles">
      <data key="d0">the hork bajir chronicles</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Hork-Bajir Chronicles is a companion book to the 'Animorphs' series, detailing events that occur in the timeline of the series and focusing on the enslavement of the Hork-Bajir by the Yeerks.</data>
