      <data key="d0">k  a  applegate</data>
      <data key="d1">person</data>
      <data key="d2">K. A. Applegate is the author of 'The Hork-Bajir Chronicles' and the 'Animorphs' series, contributing significantly to the narrative and world-building of the series.&lt;SEP&gt;K. A. Applegate is the pen name used by Katherine Applegate and Michael Grant for their collaborative writing on the Animorphs series.</data>
      <data key="d3">28e024bab6cacddbb6d7ef113c676dfdcc16af8996f82f7e937692f5e9d39517_chunk_0&lt;SEP&gt;f3a2b2d572ddc0cbf52ea5d7e5fb924e534be0480abc442170f6c083b65d07fd_chunk_0</data>
