    <node id="animorphs">
      <data key="d0">animorphs</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Animorphs is a series of books that serves as the primary context for 'The Hork-Bajir Chronicles', providing a backdrop for the events and characters within the companion book.&lt;SEP&gt;Animorphs is a science fantasy series of young adult books that explores themes such as horror, war, dehumanization, sanity, morality, innocence, leadership, freedom, and growing up.</data>
      <data key="d3">28e024bab6cacddbb6d7ef113c676dfdcc16af8996f82f7e937692f5e9d39517_chunk_0&lt;SEP&gt;f3a2b2d572ddc0cbf52ea5d7e5fb924e534be0480abc442170f6c083b65d07fd_chunk_0</data>
