      <data key="d0">the ellimist chronicles</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Ellimist Chronicles is a book within the 'Animorphs' series that precedes the events of 'The Hork-Bajir Chronicles', contributing to the overall narrative continuity.</data>
